"Sanguine charm, Choleric focus, Phlegmatic patience, or Melancholic "
"structure exactly when the situation requires it. Because no single "
"archetype takes over, they rarely suffer from extreme emotional imbalances, "
"though they may occasionally look detached or hard to define.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
